    "transcript": "If you've been trying to work on your online business, but you feel like it's stuck and it's not working and I don't know what to do. I don't know where to focus on. I got you. Everybody needs to listen up. I'm going to give you guys my number one tip after coaching hundreds of people and doing $900,000 of sales online. This is what I do with people on my calls. When they come on my coaching calls and it's like, we're all over the place. We don't know what to do. The first thing I'm going to do is let's make a plan for the next 90 days. It doesn't need to be a business plan forever. If you have a big vision and you know what you want to do, that's awesome. Let's break it up into smaller steps. If you have no idea what to do, that's awesome. You don't know what your business is going to be yet, that's a fun adventure to be on, but we need to start moving even if you don't know exactly what it needs to be yet. So, we're still going to make a 90-day plan. The reason I think this works so well is it keeps you focused. So, it doesn't give you as much time to like screw around as a whole year plan. If I make a plan for a year, I don't really have that sense of urgency and my feet are like not on the fire. So, I could take like months and months off and still have plenty of time to try to go hit that goal. The 90-day goals keeps you really focused. You don't have that much time to mess around. But, I do think it's long enough to get some really valuable data. So, one of the problems that this solves that I think is gamechanging for people is it makes you stop strategy hopping. What do I mean by strategy hopping? I'm going to tell you. [laughter] You guys can tell me in the comments if you've ever done this. I know I have. Strategy hopping looks like we pick a strategy. So, we're going to do Tik Tok. Great. Love it. We're Tik Tok. We're learning Tik Tok. We're posting on Tik Tok. We're excited. We're thinking this is going to work. This is great. It's working for other people. It's going to work for me. I can do this. It's awesome. But then like around week three, week four, week five, we stop thinking about how our plan is so great. And we start thinking, I don't know if this is working. I don't know if this is going to work. Maybe it's never going to work. Nothing is happening. Should I even be doing this? Is this a waste of time? And then the next thing you know, it's like, oh, let me do Pinterest. [laughter] That's not a strategic business decision, right? All that happened was your belief dropped and then you changed your strategy to bring your belief back up. And what I want you to do is we're going to make the 90-day plan. You're going to make all your decisions ahead of time. And then you're going to commit to keeping your thoughts lined up with your plan for 90 days. So that means if my brain starts being like, I don't know if this is working. Maybe I should do Pinterest. You're like, nope, we're doing Tik Tok for 90 days. I'm always like, you guys can write it in your planner like at the end of 90 days, April 1, you guys can look and see if you want to do Pinterest and make a strategic business decision based on data. That's one thing. Making a decision to change platforms, change your strategy, change what you're doing because your belief is low is not a good reason. And the reason why is because for most people there's a gap. Meaning you are going to start on a platform or start a sales strategy or start a marketing strategy and it is not going to work for a period of time. You have to go through that period of time to get to the result on the other side. If you are never willing to go through that gap and you're constantly changing your strategy, you will never get anywhere. So, pick a strategy, make as many decisions as you can. Besides the strategy hopping, the other big thing I see is energy leaking deciding what to do. And what I mean by that is when our brains start being like, should I do this, should I do that, should I do this, should I? I could do Pinterest, I could do TikTok, I could do this sale, I could do that sale, I could make this product, I could make that product. That is an energy leak. What you want to do with your 90-day plan is make all your decisions ahead of time. So, we're going to decide what are we going to sell, when are we going to sell, what are we going to focus on, what platforms are we going to be on, how often are we going to post, we're going to make all those decisions, and then all of the energy we were spending being like, should I do this, should I do that? We're going to take all that energy and focus it on executing our plan. Think how much energy you will get back. And then every time your brain starts to want to go to confusion, starts to want to think about changing the plan, your job is to just stay focused on the plan. Stay focused on the plan. At the end of 90 days, you can have a whole list of ideas you've had and things you want to try. We can go through them based on data and decide what you want to test next. But I really encourage you pick something and test it for 90 days. It is not a waste of time. Even if it doesn't work, we need to get that data. I'm always like, if a strategy is not going to work for me, I want to know that yesterday. I don't want to wait around being like, I don't know if it's going to work. Maybe it's not going to work. It's like I need to know. Like we need to test it. [laughter] So go out there, test it, go get some data. Even if it's data that this isn't a strategy you want to do or it's a strategy that you don't think is working the way you want and you want to do something else, that's good data to have. It's good to know that. [laughter] I'm laughing, but this is what our brains do, right? We all do this in our own little brains. So that's it. I hope you guys will make a 90-day plan. If you need help or you want me to walk you through it, I'm doing plan like a boss this Saturday, 9:00 a.m. to 400 p.m., tickets are $10 and you can upgrade to VIP for an additional $10, so $20 total. I will walk you through with my mastermind the exact process for 90 days. We'll make all those decisions ahead of time. I'll give you the mindset tools to so you can actually keep your brain on track and follow your plan. Plans don't do any good if you don't follow them. I'm sure I'm not the only one here who has made a plan and not followed it. Yeah, we're not doing that. We're going to make a plan and then we're going to put a lot of energy into focusing our brain and managing our mindset to actually be able to execute your plan. Right? If you're not executing the plan, it's not a problem with the strategy or the plan. It's a strategy with how you're thinking and a lack of managing your mind. So, I can give you those tools. We'll be doing that on Saturday if you want to come. I'm really excited about it. I'm making all new stuff and like it's going to be really fun. If you don't want to stay the whole time, you guys will get the replay. So, you can do it if 10 to four is too long, you can do it in chunks or you can stay the whole day and knock it all out with us. Either way is great. And I hope to see you there. I hope you guys have a great rest of your day. Go make your 90-day plan. I'll talk to you soon. Bye guys."
